+### What Each Line Means
+
+| Output | Meaning | Next Action |
+|--------|---------|-------------|
+| SAMPLES: PASS | All samples correct | Continue to random tests |
+| SAMPLES: FAIL | Wrong answer on sample | Fix logic error |
+| RANDOM: PASS | All random tests pass | Continue to max test |
+| RANDOM: FAIL | Algorithm has bug | Debug specific seed |
+| MAX: PASS | Runs in time | ✓ DONE! All gates pass |
+| MAX: TLE | Timeout on large input | Optimize algorithm |
