+## Round 3 Exit Conditions
+
+### ✓ SUCCESS (Exit Round 3)
+All gates pass:
+```
+SAMPLES: PASS
+RANDOM: PASS
+MAX: PASS (0.04s)
+```
+
+### → CONTINUE (Loop back in Round 3)
+Any gate fails, try new fix:
