+SAMPLES: FAIL (...)  ← Loop back
+```
+or
+```
+RANDOM: FAIL (...)  ← Loop back
+```
+or
+```
+MAX: TLE (...)  ← Loop back
+```
+
+### ✗ GIVE UP (After 5 rounds)
+If after 5 rounds still failing:
+- Fundamental misunderstanding of problem
